    "ground-convoy": [
      {
        "_comment": "Three rovers strung up one fall line under a single air overwatch, spaced so the grade under them climbs along the column: 6.0, 15.2 and 23.8 degrees. The order is deliberate - the wheeled platforms hold the gentle ground and the tracked platform, which has the steepest climb limit and the widest safe cross-slope, takes the steep end. Driving the column upslope is what exercises grade derating and the traversability probe; driving it across the slope is what exercises the rollover assessment.",
        "id": "gc-overwatch",
        "pos": [
          640.0,
          130.0,
          300.0
